  "content": "# 第26题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n26. The author's OIC project group would help ten Iraqi children to________．\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. become OIC volunteers\n\nB. B. further their education\n\nC. C. study in foreign countries\n\nD. D. influence other children\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查虚拟语气。与现在事实相反，if从句用一般过去时，be动词用were，主句用would+动词原形。故选C。"
}